Debugging Huy — Known Issues & Support Plan
:::

:::shape id=s6_card1_bg x=80 y=140 w=445 h=220 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s6_card1_txt x=100 y=155 w=405 h=190 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="help-circle" color="#06B6D4"]:::
**Issue #1: Asks too many questions**
*Behavior*: Asks too many questions before committing.
*Support*: Provide clear context on its business, product, or team relevance.
:::

:::shape id=s6_card2_bg x=564 y=140 w=445 h=220 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s6_card2_txt x=584 y=155 w=405 h=190 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="battery-low" color="#06B6D4"]:::
**Issue #2: Low energy response**
*Behavior*: Slow response when running on low energy.
*Support*: Give time to recover, feel free to ask for faster response if urgent.
:::

:::shape id=s6_card3_bg x=80 y=390 w=445 h=220 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s6_card3_txt x=100 y=405 w=405 h=190 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="activity" color="#06B6D4"]:::
**Issue #3: Over-excited communication**
*Behavior*: Incoherent when getting over-excited.
*Support*: Give time to sink in; echo back what you hear.
:::

:::shape id=s6_card4_bg x=564 y=390 w=445 h=220 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s6_card4_txt x=584 y=405 w=405 h=190 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="alert-triangle" color="#06B6D4"]:::
**Issue #4: Pushing too hard**
*Behavior*: Sometimes pushing too hard on self and people.
*Support*: Explain if not working or if energy is better spent elsewhere.
:::